	constraint Haplorhini partial = Piliocolobus Allochrocebus Leontocebus Allenopithecus Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Cacajao Callimico Callithrix Carlito Cebuella Cebus Cephalopachus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Cheracebus Chiropotes Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Lagothrix Leontopithecus Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Mico Miopithecus Nasalis Nomascus Pan Rungwecebus Papio Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Pongo Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Saguinus Saimiri Sapajus Semnopithecus Simias Symphalangus Tarsius Theropithecus Trachypithecus : Arctocebus Avahi Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Eulemur Euoticus Sciurocheirus Paragalago Galago Galagoides Hapalemur Indri Lemur Lepilemur Loris Microcebus Mirza Nycticebus Otolemur Perodicticus Phaner Prolemur Propithecus Varecia Xanthonycticebus;
	constraint Strepsirrhini partial = Paragalago Galago Arctocebus Avahi Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Eulemur Euoticus Sciurocheirus Galagoides Hapalemur Indri Lemur Lepilemur Loris Microcebus Mirza Nycticebus Otolemur Perodicticus Phaner Prolemur Propithecus Varecia Xanthonycticebus : Galeopterus Piliocolobus Allochrocebus Leontocebus Allenopithecus Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Cacajao Callimico Callithrix Carlito Cebuella Cebus Cephalopachus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Cheracebus Chiropotes Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Lagothrix Leontopithecus Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Mico Miopithecus Nasalis Nomascus Pan Rungwecebus Papio  Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Pongo Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Saguinus Saimiri Sapajus Semnopithecus Simias Symphalangus Tarsius Theropithecus Trachypithecus;
	constraint Lorisidae partial = Galago Arctocebus Loris Nycticebus Perodicticus Xanthonycticebus : Galeopterus Paragalago Piliocolobus Allochrocebus Leontocebus Allenopithecus Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Cacajao Callimico Callithrix Carlito Cebuella Cebus Cephalopachus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Cheracebus Chiropotes Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Lagothrix Leontopithecus Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Mico Miopithecus Nasalis Nomascus Pan Rungwecebus Papio  Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Pongo Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Saguinus Saimiri Sapajus Semnopithecus Simias Symphalangus Tarsius Theropithecus Trachypithecus Avahi Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Eulemur Euoticus Sciurocheirus Galagoides Hapalemur Indri Lemur Lepilemur Microcebus Mirza  Otolemur Phaner Prolemur Propithecus Varecia; 
	constraint Cheirogaleidae partial = Allocebus Cheirogaleus Microcebus Mirza Phaner : Galeopterus Paragalago Piliocolobus Allochrocebus Leontocebus Allenopithecus Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Cacajao Callimico Callithrix Carlito Cebuella Cebus Cephalopachus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Cheracebus Chiropotes Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Lagothrix Leontopithecus Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Mico Miopithecus Nasalis Nomascus Pan Rungwecebus Papio  Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Pongo Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Saguinus Saimiri Sapajus Semnopithecus Simias Symphalangus Tarsius Theropithecus Trachypithecus Galago Arctocebus Avahi Daubentonia Eulemur Euoticus Sciurocheirus Galagoides Hapalemur Indri Lemur Lepilemur Loris  Nycticebus Otolemur Perodicticus Prolemur Propithecus Varecia Xanthonycticebus;
	constraint Galagidae partial = Paragalago Euoticus Sciurocheirus Galagoides Otolemur : Galeopterus Piliocolobus Allochrocebus Leontocebus  Allenopithecus Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Cacajao Callimico Callithrix Carlito Cebuella Cebus Cephalopachus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Cheracebus Chiropotes Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Lagothrix Leontopithecus Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Mico Miopithecus Nasalis Nomascus Pan Rungwecebus Papio  Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Pongo Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Saguinus Saimiri Sapajus Semnopithecus Simias Symphalangus Tarsius Theropithecus Trachypithecus Galago Arctocebus Avahi Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Eulemur Hapalemur Indri Lemur Lepilemur Loris Microcebus Mirza Nycticebus Perodicticus Phaner Prolemur Propithecus Varecia Xanthonycticebus;
	constraint Lemuridae partial = Eulemur Hapalemur Lemur Prolemur Varecia : Galeopterus Piliocolobus Allochrocebus Leontocebus Allenopithecus Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Cacajao Callimico Callithrix Carlito Cebuella Cebus Cephalopachus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Cheracebus Chiropotes Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Lagothrix Leontopithecus Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Mico Miopithecus Nasalis Nomascus Pan Rungwecebus Papio  Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Pongo Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Saguinus Saimiri Sapajus Semnopithecus Simias Symphalangus Tarsius Theropithecus Trachypithecus Galago Arctocebus Avahi Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Euoticus Sciurocheirus Galagoides Indri Lepilemur Loris Microcebus Mirza Nycticebus Otolemur Perodicticus Phaner Propithecus Xanthonycticebus;
	constraint Indriidae partial = Avahi Indri Propithecus : Galeopterus Paragalago Allenopithecus Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Cacajao Callimico Callithrix Carlito Cebuella Cebus Cephalopachus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Cheracebus Chiropotes Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Lagothrix Leontopithecus Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Mico Miopithecus Nasalis Nomascus Pan Rungwecebus Papio  Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Pongo Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Saguinus Saimiri Sapajus Semnopithecus Simias Symphalangus Tarsius Theropithecus Trachypithecus Arctocebus Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Eulemur Euoticus Sciurocheirus Galagoides Hapalemur Lepilemur Loris Microcebus Mirza Nycticebus Lemur Otolemur Perodicticus Phaner Prolemur Varecia Xanthonycticebus;
	constraint Tarsiidae partial = Carlito Cephalopachus Tarsius : Galeopterus Paragalago Galago Arctocebus Avahi Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Eulemur Euoticus Sciurocheirus Galagoides Hapalemur Indri Lemur Lepilemur Loris Microcebus Mirza Nycticebus Otolemur Perodicticus Phaner Prolemur Propithecus Varecia Xanthonycticebus Allenopithecus Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Cacajao Callimico Callithrix Cebuella Cebus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Cheracebus Chiropotes Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Lagothrix Leontopithecus Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Mico Miopithecus Nasalis Nomascus Pan Rungwecebus Papio  Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Pongo Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Saguinus Saimiri Sapajus Semnopithecus Simias Symphalangus Theropithecus Trachypithecus;
	constraint Simiiformes partial = Piliocolobus Allochrocebus Leontocebus Allenopithecus Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Cacajao Callimico Callithrix Cebuella Cebus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Cheracebus Chiropotes Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Lagothrix Leontopithecus Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Mico Miopithecus Nasalis Nomascus Pan Rungwecebus Papio  Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Pongo Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Saguinus Saimiri Sapajus Semnopithecus Simias Symphalangus Theropithecus Trachypithecus : Galeopterus Arctocebus Avahi Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Eulemur Euoticus Sciurocheirus Paragalago Galago Galagoides Hapalemur Indri Lemur Lepilemur Loris Microcebus Mirza Nycticebus Otolemur Perodicticus Phaner Prolemur Propithecus Varecia Xanthonycticebus Carlito Cephalopachus Tarsius;
	constraint Platyrrhini partial = Leontocebus Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Cacajao Callimico Callithrix Cebuella Cebus Cheracebus Chiropotes Lagothrix Leontopithecus Mico Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Saguinus Saimiri Sapajus : Galeopterus Arctocebus Avahi Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Eulemur Euoticus Sciurocheirus Paragalago Galago Galagoides Hapalemur Indri Lemur Lepilemur Loris Microcebus Mirza Nycticebus Otolemur Perodicticus Phaner Prolemur Propithecus Varecia Xanthonycticebus Carlito Cephalopachus Tarsius Allenopithecus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Miopithecus Nasalis Nomascus Pan Rungwecebus Papio  Piliocolobus Pongo Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Semnopithecus Simias Symphalangus Theropithecus Trachypithecus;
	constraint Pitheciidae partial = Cacajao Cheracebus Chiropotes Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus : Galeopterus Paragalago Galago Arctocebus Avahi Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Eulemur Euoticus Sciurocheirus Galagoides Hapalemur Indri Lemur Lepilemur Loris Microcebus Mirza Nycticebus Otolemur Perodicticus Phaner Prolemur Propithecus Varecia Xanthonycticebus Carlito Cephalopachus Tarsius Allenopithecus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Miopithecus Nasalis Nomascus Pan Rungwecebus Papio  Pongo Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Semnopithecus Simias Symphalangus Theropithecus Trachypithecus Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Callimico Callithrix Cebuella Cebus Lagothrix Leontopithecus Mico Saguinus Saimiri Sapajus;
	constraint Atelidae partial = Alouatta Ateles Brachyteles Lagothrix : Galeopterus Paragalago Galago Arctocebus Avahi Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Eulemur Euoticus Sciurocheirus Galagoides Hapalemur Indri Lemur Lepilemur Loris Microcebus Mirza Nycticebus Otolemur Perodicticus Phaner Prolemur Propithecus Varecia Xanthonycticebus Carlito Cephalopachus Tarsius Allenopithecus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Miopithecus Nasalis Nomascus Pan Rungwecebus Papio  Pongo Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Semnopithecus Simias Symphalangus Theropithecus Trachypithecus Aotus Cacajao Callimico Callithrix Cebuella Cebus Cheracebus Chiropotes Leontopithecus Mico Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Saguinus Saimiri Sapajus;
	constraint Cebidae partial = Cebus Saimiri Sapajus : Galeopterus Paragalago Galago Arctocebus Avahi Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Eulemur Euoticus Sciurocheirus Galagoides Hapalemur Indri Lemur Lepilemur Loris Microcebus Mirza Nycticebus Otolemur Perodicticus Phaner Prolemur Propithecus Varecia Xanthonycticebus Carlito Cephalopachus Tarsius Allenopithecus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Miopithecus Nasalis Nomascus Pan Rungwecebus Papio  Pongo Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Semnopithecus Simias Symphalangus Theropithecus Trachypithecus Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Cacajao Callimico Callithrix Cebuella Cheracebus Chiropotes Lagothrix Leontopithecus Mico Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Saguinus;
	constraint Callitrichidae partial = Leontocebus Callimico Callithrix Cebuella Leontopithecus Mico Saguinus : Galeopterus Galago Arctocebus Avahi Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Eulemur Euoticus Sciurocheirus Galagoides Hapalemur Indri Lemur Lepilemur Loris Microcebus Mirza Nycticebus Otolemur Perodicticus Phaner Prolemur Propithecus Varecia Xanthonycticebus Carlito Cephalopachus Tarsius Allenopithecus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Miopithecus Nasalis Nomascus Pan Rungwecebus Papio  Pongo Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Semnopithecus Simias Symphalangus Theropithecus Trachypithecus Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Cacajao Cebus Cheracebus Chiropotes Lagothrix Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Saimiri Sapajus;
	constraint Catarrhini partial = Piliocolobus Allochrocebus Allenopithecus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Miopithecus Nasalis Nomascus Pan Rungwecebus Papio  Pongo Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Semnopithecus Simias Symphalangus Theropithecus Trachypithecus : Galeopterus Arctocebus Avahi Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Eulemur Euoticus Sciurocheirus Paragalago Galago Galagoides Hapalemur Indri Lemur Lepilemur Loris Microcebus Mirza Nycticebus Otolemur Perodicticus Phaner Prolemur Propithecus Varecia Xanthonycticebus Carlito Cephalopachus Tarsius Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Cacajao Callimico Callithrix Cebuella Cebus Cheracebus Chiropotes Lagothrix Leontopithecus Mico Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Saguinus Saimiri Sapajus;
	constraint Cercopithecidae partial = Piliocolobus Allochrocebus Allenopithecus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Miopithecus Nasalis Rungwecebus Papio Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Semnopithecus Simias Theropithecus Trachypithecus : Galeopterus Arctocebus Avahi Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Eulemur Euoticus Sciurocheirus Paragalago Galago Galagoides Hapalemur Indri Lemur Lepilemur Loris Microcebus Mirza Nycticebus Otolemur Perodicticus Phaner Prolemur Propithecus Varecia Xanthonycticebus Carlito Cephalopachus Tarsius Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Cacajao Callimico Callithrix Cebuella Cebus Cheracebus Chiropotes Lagothrix Leontopithecus Mico Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Saguinus Saimiri Sapajus Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Nomascus Pan Pongo Symphalangus;
	constraint Cercopithecinae partial = Allochrocebus Allenopithecus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Chlorocebus Erythrocebus Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Miopithecus Rungwecebus Papio Theropithecus : Galeopterus Colobus Piliocolobus Nasalis Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Semnopithecus Simias Trachypithecus;
	constraint Papionini partial =  Cercocebus Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Rungwecebus Papio Theropithecus : Allochrocebus Allenopithecus Cercopithecus Chlorocebus Erythrocebus Miopithecus;
	constraint Hylobatidae partial = Hoolock Hylobates Nomascus Symphalangus : Arctocebus Avahi Allocebus Cheirogaleus Daubentonia Eulemur Euoticus Sciurocheirus Paragalago Galago Galagoides Hapalemur Indri Lemur Lepilemur Loris Microcebus Mirza Nycticebus Otolemur Perodicticus Phaner Prolemur Propithecus Varecia Xanthonycticebus Carlito Cephalopachus Tarsius Alouatta Aotus Ateles Brachyteles Cacajao Callimico Callithrix Cebuella Cebus Cheracebus Chiropotes Lagothrix Leontopithecus Mico Pithecia Callicebus Plecturocebus Saguinus Saimiri Sapajus Allenopithecus Cercocebus Cercopithecus Chlorocebus Colobus Erythrocebus Lophocebus Macaca Mandrillus Miopithecus Nasalis Rungwecebus Papio  Presbytis Procolobus Pygathrix Rhinopithecus Semnopithecus Simias Theropithecus Trachypithecus Gorilla Homo Pan Pongo;
	constraint Hominoidea hard = Gorilla Homo Hoolock Hylobates Nomascus Pan Pongo Symphalangus;
	constraint Hominidae hard = Gorilla Homo Pan Pongo;

	[The following lines set up a standard model and an HKY model + gamma rate variation + proportion of invariable sites model]
	lset applyto = (1) rates = gamma;
	lset applyto = (2,3) nst = 2 rates = invgamma ngammacat=4;

	[Unless the parameters are explicitly unlinked, they will be shared across partitions. The unlink command is used to unlink the parameters.]
	unlink shape = (all) pinvar = (all) statefreq = (all) revmat = (all) tratio=(all);
	
	[The following line allows rates to vary across partitions]
	prset applyto = (all) ratepr = variable;
		
	[Chronogram settings; relaxed clock model]
		prset brlenspr = clock:uniform;
		
		[independent gamma rates (IGR) model - a continuous uncorrelated model of rate variation across lineages]
		prset clockvarpr = igr; 
		
		[The rate at which the variance of the effective branch length increases over time. Default setting is exp(10)]
		[Note, MrBayes uses a hazard parameter for exponential distributions, not means. The hazard
		parameter is the inverse of the mean, so specifying exp(10) is the same as specifying an exponential
		prior distribution having mean 0.1.]
		prset igrvarpr = exp(10); 
		
		[setting the prior on the clock rate. By default, the clock rate is going to be fixed to 1.0] 
		[Using 0.01 plus/minus 0.007 substitutions per site per million years]
		prset clockratepr = normal(0.015, 0.005);
		
		[Modify the tree age prior to an exponential distribution with the rate 0.01]
		[This prior is not used because we calibrate the age of the root]
		[prset treeagepr=exponential(0.01);]
		
		[node calibrations. The offset exponential distribution has its expectation at the minimum age and mean. That is, the offsetexponential(300,325) has the minimum 300 and an exponential mean of 325.]
		[Node calibrations from: Dorien and Beck, 2023 https://doi.org/10.26879/1249]
		calibrate Euarchonta = offsetexponential(65,80) [Primatomorpha-Scandentia split; the Root];
		calibrate Primatomorpha = offsetexponential(57,65) [Primates-Dermoptera split, note there is no maximum given in Dorien & Beck];
		calibrate Hominoidea = offsetexponential(13.4, 15) [Hominidae-Hylobatidae split];
		calibrate Hominidae = offsetexponential(12.3, 13) [Homininae-Ponginae split];

		[tip dates; calibrations]
		calibrate
			Allenopithecus = fixed(0)
			Allocebus = fixed(0)
			Allochrocebus = fixed(0)
			Alouatta = fixed(0)
			Aotus = fixed(0)
			Arctocebus = fixed(0)
			Ateles = fixed(0)
			Avahi = fixed(0)
